<!-- Teaching layer over exact approved source fb8354e. -->
<!-- @opening -->
<p class="story-lead">A refresh requested before an edit returns after the edit’s successful response. Showing whichever response arrived last can make a saved change disappear even though the server is correct.</p>

<!-- @before Monotonic Reads :: animation -->
### A late response is not a newer state

<section class="pb-figure" data-pb-flow="scene" aria-label="Keep revision 8 when revision 7 arrives late">
